# Workflow Playbook — secrets template
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in the project root and fill in the values yourself.
# `.env` is untracked and never committed. Never paste the values into chat:
# the assistant asks for the variable NAME only and reads the value from .env.
#
# Add one NAME= line per credential the project needs, for example:
#
# GITEA_TOKEN=
# GITEA_USER=
# DEPLOY_PASSWORD=
